  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ab365450-2ea2-5bfe-ae0f-158093a3da33" activityNameId="fd8ee010-3bcc-5196-b5af-f15c7967020b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production efforts, diodes</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production efforts, diodes
Data are a rough estimation of the average production efforts over all types of diodes. Data for auxillaries, energy, emissions and waste are taken from a dataset ouf of an international LCI database. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions. Updates were made in 2023, showing that 20% energy reduction is achieved; UUID: ef82093f-2834-3c32-bd68-840ffcfd7146
This module includes auxillary and energy consumption, emissions (air, water) and waste amounts, as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of diodes.
Location: Data from literature – here representing the global situation.
Technology: average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ef82093f-2834-3c32-bd68-840ffcfd7146.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
